  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 190c92c32ecfb5943982286463bdd245, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NotePopUp
  letterUI: {fileID: 839769747}
  letterText: {fileID: 170560571}
  text: 'Boys,


    After few days, I finally was able to go through each house
    in this village. Our targets are the three wooden houses, they have all the good
    stuff. We will do the work tonight. Follow the usual plan, no witnesses, and
    no traces. We have to stay unnoticed to the army, locals still think all those
    attacks were by some monster, we need to use this legend to the maximum.


    -J'
